  wx      wxGauge (SetValue, SetRange)

capability ui/progress-moving  a progress bar that moves with no value
  heroes  ui.set_moving
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  -
  wx      wxGauge (Pulse)
  note    `ProgressBar.SetValue(-1)` and `ttk.Progressbar`'s indeterminate mode, which their blocks above name; macOS by `NSProgressIndicator`'s indeterminate state, Windows by `PBS_MARQUEE` and `PBM_SETMARQUEE`, Linux by `gtk_progress_bar_pulse` every 100 ms

capability ui/slider  a knob the person drags between two values
  heroes  ui.slider, ui.set_value, ui.value_of, ui.set_range, ui.Event.value_changed
  go      ui.NewSlider, Slider.SetValue, Slider.Value, Slider.OnChanged
  rust    -
